  "richContent": "<p>发车记录</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【150】</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>目前500 还持有6份 = 富国 x 1份 + 建信 x 2份 + 华夏 x 3份 </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>目前国内纯债 持有7份 = 广发 1-3 年国开债 x 1份+ 易方达 1-3 年国开债 x 4份 + 7-10国开债 x1 份 + 景顺景泰纯债 x 1份</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【S】</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>无操作，仅同步更新数据</p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【图8】查了查那“超长线巨量机构”用的其中一个500ETF情况。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>【图9】尝试同款表达方式制图。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/6588B3E8-5E34-4659-8A47-C059BB1E117D.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/46ED0619-F594-41F7-805B-413CF6A98719.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/D9DCD85B-121B-41CB-81ED-D246550B1CA5.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/E54C75D8-2B25-49AC-9913-2C236D5AF081.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/55671FA3-3721-4A55-A693-373D84A52E2F.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/FD997D7F-59F8-4A75-8348-B2BBD99585E4.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/C716B875-2CC2-4907-97CB-A008A3C8FC4E.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/96660561-58B0-4CD5-BAB9-778C9E2B0109.jpg\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/7580FF41-235F-4204-9C2E-C21F8CACFDE9.jpg\" />",
